msgid "Lead your banners in grid tactics and field battles."
msgstr "率领你的旗帜，进行格子战术与野战。"

msgid "Lookout"
msgstr "瞭望台"

msgid "To the lookout"
msgstr "前往瞭望台"

msgid "The whole valley lies below."
msgstr "整个山谷尽收眼底。"

msgid "Back to the start"
msgstr "返回起点"

msgid "%s move · %s use · %s save · %s load"
msgstr "%s 移动 · %s 使用 · %s 存档 · %s 读档"

msgid "Camp"
msgstr "营地"

msgid "War Table"
msgstr "战术桌"

msgid "Plan the Battle"
msgstr "筹划战斗"

msgid "Border Ford"
msgstr "边境渡口"

msgid "Strike"
msgstr "斩击"

msgid "Shoot"
msgstr "射击"

msgid "Mend"
msgstr "治疗"

msgid "Smash"
msgstr "重砸"

msgid "Firepot"
msgstr "火罐"

msgid "Swordsman"
msgstr "剑士"

msgid "Archer"
msgstr "弓手"

msgid "Cleric"
msgstr "牧师"

msgid "Raider"
msgstr "劫掠者"

msgid "Brute"
msgstr "蛮兵"

msgid "Slinger"
msgstr "投石手"

msgid "Muster"
msgstr "集结点"

msgid "Lead the Troops"
msgstr "率军出征"

msgid "Hill Pass"
msgstr "山口"

msgid "Spearman"
msgstr "长枪兵"

msgid "Bowman"
msgstr "弓兵"

msgid "Rider"
msgstr "骑兵"

msgid "Move with {move}. Press {interact} to use what is near."
msgstr "用 {move} 移动，按 {interact} 使用身旁的东西。"

msgid "A lost battle can be fought again whenever you are ready."
msgstr "打输的仗，准备好了随时可以再打一次。"

msgid "Captain Aldis"
msgstr "奥迪斯队长"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Captain Aldis"
msgstr "奥迪斯队长"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Welcome to camp. Raiders hold the ford and the hill pass, and we take both back."
msgstr "欢迎来到营地。掠夺者占着渡口和山口，我们要把两处都夺回来。"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "How do we fight at the ford?"
msgstr "渡口那一仗怎么打？"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Plan it on the war table. Each soldier moves and acts in turn; keep the cleric close to mend the wounded."
msgstr "在战术桌上筹划。士兵轮流移动和行动；让牧师跟紧些，好治疗伤员。"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "And the pass?"
msgstr "那山口呢？"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Lead the troops from the muster. Pick out soldiers, send them where they are needed, and they fight on their own."
msgstr "从集结点率军出发。选中士兵，派他们去需要的地方，他们会自己作战。"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "To work, then."
msgstr "那就开工吧。"

msgctxt "dialogue"
msgid "Good luck out there."
msgstr "祝你好运。"
